{'symbol': 'GLW', 'date': '2022-10-05 14:10:00', 'title': 'CORNING ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "CORNING, N.Y. , OCT. 05, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CORNING INCORPORATED'S (NYSE: GLW) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.27 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON DEC. 16, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOV. 18, 2022."}